+/**
+ * @defgroup    cose_cryto_wolfcrypt_mldsa Crypto glue layer, wolfCrypt ML-DSA definitions
+ * @ingroup     cose_crypto
+ *
+ * Crypto function api for glueing wolfCrypt's ML-DSA-65 implementation.
+ * @{
+ *
+ * @file
+ * @brief       Crypto function api for glueing wolfCrypt ML-DSA-65.
